<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks fall at end-Jan from Dec.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks fall at end-Jan from Dec.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-January rubber stock figures, issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association, with month-earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes, were as follows:</p>
<p>    Month	    Jan 97   Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>    Stocks	   41,599   43,244   36,116</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes</p>
<p>    Crude rubber   35,607   37,366   29,680</p>
<p>    Synthetic	 5,846    5,761    6,330</p>
<p>    Latex		 146	117	106</p>
</text>
